{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32619","headline":"江行夜泊 · 刘沧","name":"江行夜泊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白浪连空极渺漫，孤舟此夜泊中滩。\n岳阳秋霁寺钟远，渡口月明渔火残。\n绿绮韵高湘女怨，青葭色映水禽寒。\n乡遥楚国生归思，欲曙山光上木兰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32619.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32619","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}